---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import CareerDatabaseVerificationWorkbench from '../../components/CareerDatabaseVerificationWorkbench.astro';
import { CAREER_DATABASE_VERIFICATION_QUEUE } from '../../config/careerRouteDataset';

const title = 'Career Database Verification Workbench | Future Career School';
const description = 'A private browser-local workbench for preparing primary-source review packets for queued career records. It does not publish or verify records automatically.';
const canonical = 'https://futurecareerschool.com/tools/career-database-verification-workbench/';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <Nav activePage="tools" />
  <main><section class="tool-hero container"><p class="eyebrow">EDITORIAL REVIEW TOOL · NOT A PUBLIC DATABASE</p><h1>Career database <span>verification workbench</span></h1><p class="lead">Prepare a review packet for one of the 50 queued career routes: record the responsible verifier, source URLs, date, checked fields and unresolved conflicts before anyone considers publication.</p><p class="tool-limits"><b>Private by design:</b> drafts stay in this browser unless you export them. This tool does not verify sources, change the catalogue or publish a record.</p></section><section class="container tool-shell"><CareerDatabaseVerificationWorkbench queue={CAREER_DATABASE_VERIFICATION_QUEUE} /></section><section class="container tool-explainer"><h2>Publication gate</h2><p>A draft is not evidence. A record remains unpublished until every material field has a primary source, a named verifier, a last-verified date, a review cadence and a correction path. See the <a href="/research-and-datasets/">research registry</a> and <a href="/data-policy/">data policy</a>.</p></section></main><Footer />
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .tool-hero{padding:5rem 1.25rem 2rem}.tool-hero h1{max-width:850px}.tool-hero h1 span{color:var(--gold,#e5b84a)}.lead{max-width:780px;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.7}.tool-limits{max-width:780px;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#b9c2c1)}.tool-shell{max-width:1100px}.tool-explainer{padding:2rem 1.25rem 5rem;max-width:1000px}.tool-explainer h2{margin-top:0}.tool-explainer p{line-height:1.7}.tool-explainer a{color:#0b8579;text-decoration:underline}
</style>
